Design Engineering Tip

Consider letting textareas grow with the content instead of introducing nested scrolling. It often creates a smoother writing experience and keeps forms easier to scan.

CSS:
textarea {
field-sizing: content;
} https://t.co/MZPOnNEaLt

Raymond is curious about AI, everyday life, and humanistic ideas. 
In an age where almost anything can be generated, he still looks for the things AI can’t quite replace. 🩶

